_:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ExpressionOfConcern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/spar/fabio/Comment> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#rationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records a textual justification attached to a tido:PieceOfInformation, such as an extracted value or an assessment conclusion. For example, it may store a reviewer note defending a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ExpressionOfConcern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Expression of concern"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#PublicationDetails> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the textual justification for assigning a value to ripe:studyEndDate in a ripe:StudyDesignEvidence instance. For example, it may explain why a final follow-up date was treated as the study end date."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "registration identifier"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#resultOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Integrity assessment question"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Person> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "study end date extraction rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#retractionWatchRecordId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Work> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/spar/fabio/Work> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis is a tido:Hypothesis that records an automated or human-reviewed answer to a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion. For example, a reviewer or automated agent may produce a hypothesis that a study has no concerns, some concerns, or serious concerns."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationAssessmentRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#isProspective> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records whether a ripe:RegistryEvidence instance supports the judgement that the study was prospectively registered. For example, a value of true indicates that registration was assessed as preceding the relevant study start point."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationAssessmentRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "registration assessment rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#rationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Integrity assessment hypothesis"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registryName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
_:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Work> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#isProspective> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "registration link"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#isProspective> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is prospective"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the date value assigned as the participant recruitment end in a ripe:StudyDesignEvidence instance. For example, it may capture an enrolment end date reported in the article text."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#EvidenceAggregation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#concerns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb1 .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the textual justification for assigning a value to ripe:recruitmentEndDate in a ripe:StudyDesignEvidence instance. For example, the agent responsible for gathering the ripe:recruitmentEndDate may state that the end of enrolment was inferred from the methods described in the study protocol."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ExpressionOfConcern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RetractionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#resultOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recruitment start date"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recruitment end date"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#AutomatedAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Automated agent"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#EvidenceAggregation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evidence aggregation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#assesses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assesses"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tido#Hypothesis> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#EvidenceAggregation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:EvidenceAggregation is a prov:Activity representing the aggregation of evidence and source records used in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. It provides provenance for the evidence collected for one ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. Retrieval of registry records and publication notices for a research integrity assessment is one such activity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#PeerComment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "registration date"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#isProspective> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registryName> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RetractionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:RetractionNotice is a fabio:RetractionNotice and ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence representing a formal retraction notice used as evidence in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. For example, a journal-issued retraction notice for an article is a ripe:RetractionNotice."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#resultOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "result outcome"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#AutomatedAgent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the textual justification for assigning a value to ripe:recruitmentStartDate in a ripe:StudyDesignEvidence instance. For example, it may note that a sentence describing when enrolment began was interpreted as the recruitment start date by the agent responsible."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#isProspective> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:RegistryEvidence is a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence representing information recorded in a registry about a registered study or clinical trial. It may record values such as the registry identifier, registration date, registry name, registry link, and the associated registration assessment rationale. A ClinicalTrials.gov or WHO ICTRP entry associated with a clinical trial publication is one such instance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ExpressionOfConcern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#OverallIntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:OverallIntegrityAssessmentQuestion is a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion representing the overall integrity question investigated for a ripe:Work within a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. It is answered by one or more ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances that synthesise the component integrity assessment questions and their corresponding hypotheses."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationAssessmentRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RetractionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#PeerComment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#concerns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence instance to the ripe:Work or ripe:Author to which the evidence applies. This property is used when an evidence item bears on a work, an author associated with that work, or both. For example, publication metadata, registry evidence, and peer comments may relate to a ripe:Work via ripe:concerns, while a publication notice may also relate to one or more ripe:Author instances via ripe:concerns."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Author"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#assesses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Work> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#PeerComment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:PeerComment is a fabio:Comment and ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence representing a post-publication comment from the research community about a work and used as evidence in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. For example, a PubPeer comment discussing methodological concerns is a ripe:PeerComment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RetractionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/spar/fabio/RetractionNotice> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registryName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#retractionWatchRecordId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "retraction watch record identifier"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#assesses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ResearchIntegrityAssessment> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-05-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:StudyDesignEvidence is a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence representing information about the design and timeline of a registered study or clinical trial. It may record values such as recruitment start, recruitment end, and study end dates, together with rationales supporting those assigned values. A record describing the recruitment and completion timeline of a clinical study is one such instance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Work> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Work"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0" .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#OverallIntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Overall integrity assessment question"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#HumanReviewer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Person> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#rationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/tido#PieceOfInformation> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence is a tido:Evidence item used to support, challenge, or contextualise a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. Publication metadata, registry evidence, study-design evidence, publication notices, and peer comments used in an integrity assessment are examples of ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#AutomatedAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:AutomatedAgent is a prov:SoftwareAgent representing a software agent that participates in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment by gathering evidence, deriving assessment-relevant information, or producing initial outcomes. Software that can perform ripe:EvidenceAggregation and produce ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances without human intervention is modelled as a ripe:AutomatedAgent."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recruitment end date extraction rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#HumanReviewer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:HumanReviewer is a prov:Person and foaf:Person representing a human agent who participates in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment by evaluating evidence and recording ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances. A systematic reviewer investigating research integrity of a study is a ripe:HumanReviewer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#AutomatedAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#SoftwareAgent> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the registry identifier associated with a ripe:RegistryEvidence instance. For example, this may be an NCT or ISRCTN number."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#PublicationDetails> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:PublicationDetails is a fabio:BibliographicMetadata and ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence representing bibliographic metadata describing a work. It may record values such as title, publication venue, publisher, identifiers, and publication date. A record containing title, journal, publisher, and publication date for an article is one such instance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RetractionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Retraction notice"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#concerns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#rationale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#HumanReviewer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationAssessmentRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the textual justification for the registration-status assessment represented by a ripe:RegistryEvidence instance. For example, it may explain that the registry submission date was compared with the recruitment start date."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:Author is a prov:Person and foaf:Person representing a person associated with an assessment-relevant resource represented in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. Such resources may include works and other pieces of information, such as peer comments. The author of a journal article or the person named as responsible for a peer comment are examples of ripe:Author."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ResearchIntegrityAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Research integrity assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-05-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#CorrectionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#CorrectionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/spar/fabio/Correction> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Work> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the registration date value associated with a ripe:RegistryEvidence instance. For example, it may store the submission date shown in a ClinicalTrials.gov record."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "study end date"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Research Integrity Provenance and Evidence Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tido#RQ> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Registry evidence"@en .
_:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb2 .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#StudyDesignEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#CorrectionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Correction notice"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#PeerComment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Peer comment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#resultOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the lexical outcome assigned to a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis in answer to a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion. For example, an outcome may record a check-level answer such as yes, no, or unclear, or an overall assessment such as no-concerns, some-concerns, or serious-concerns."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tido#Evidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#rationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ExpressionOfConcern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:ExpressionOfConcern is a fabio:Comment and ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence representing a formal journal or publisher notice that raises concerns about a work and is used as evidence in a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. For example, a publisher notice questioning the reliability of a published article is an expression of concern."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the date value assigned as the study end in a ripe:StudyDesignEvidence instance. For example, it may capture a reported study completion or final follow-up date."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registryName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "registry name"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#resultOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#retractionWatchRecordId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registryName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the name of the trial registry represented by a ripe:RegistryEvidence instance. For example, values may include ClinicalTrials.gov, ISRCTN, or WHO ICTRP."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#CorrectionNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#RegistryEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ResearchIntegrityAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#HumanReviewer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Human reviewer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#EvidenceAggregation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tido#Activity> .
_:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb3 .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#IntegrityAssessmentQuestion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion is a tido:RQ and prov:Entity representing one specific integrity-related question investigated within a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment. It is answered by one or more ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances via tido:answers. An example of a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion is a question asking whether a ripe:Work has an associated retraction."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#assesses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment to the ripe:Work that is the subject of the assessment. For example, one ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment may assess a single trial publication."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Research Integrity Provenance and Evidence Ontology (RIPE-O) can be used to describe provenance traces of research integrity assessment processes combining evidence, hypotheses, activities, agents, and human-generated or automated assessment outputs."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the date value assigned as the participant recruitment start in a ripe:StudyDesignEvidence instance. For example, it may capture a month-year or date string when the first participant was enrolled for a study."@en .
_:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Author> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o/1.0.0> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the URI of the registry record represented by a ripe:RegistryEvidence instance. For example, it may point to a ClinicalTrials.gov or WHO ICTRP record page."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#retractionWatchRecordId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the source identifier assigned by the Retraction Watch database to a ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence item when such an identifier is available. In the RIPE-KG, this is used for retraction notices, expressions of concern, and correction notices sourced from Retraction Watch."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Author> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#ResearchIntegrityAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ripe:ResearchIntegrityAssessment represents one integrity assessment of a work. It brings together the ripe:Work that is the subject of the assessment, the ripe:IntegrityAssessmentQuestion instances investigated, the ripe:IntegrityAssessmentHypothesis instances answering those questions, the ripe:IntegrityAssessmentEvidence instances supporting them, and the activities that generated or reviewed those outcomes. An assessment of a single published clinical trial report is one such instance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#registrationDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentEndDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
_:n86d377095f1141e2aabe1418b5aa7afcb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#Work> .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#recruitmentStartDateExtractionRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recruitment start date extraction rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ripe/ripe-o#studyEndDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
